  "description": "High-performance AST-based template parser for .NET with HTML-like syntax, component system, layouts, slots, and enterprise-grade security. Cross-platform compatible with .NET Standard 2.0, .NET Framework 4.8, .NET 6.0+, .NET 8.0+, .NET 9.0+, and .NET 10.0+.",
